    "background_story": "Randy was a man who lived a life so ordinary, it was almost extraordinary. He worked as an accountant in a small firm, crunching numbers day in and day out. His daily routine was a masterclass in monotony - wake up, go to work, come home, watch TV, and sleep. Randy's life was a series of nonevents, devoid of drama or excitement. He never traveled, never took risks, and never rocked the boat. His friends and family would often joke that Randy's life was so predictable, you could set your watch to it. And yet, despite the lack of excitement, Randy was content. He found comfort in the familiar rhythms of his life and took pride in being a steady, reliable presence in the lives of those around him. Randy's noneventful life was, in its own way, a remarkable achievement.",
